{1}{G:}{G:}{}{}{}{}
{2}{I was told to speak to Ogdin.}{}{5}{me 0,gf1058 1,gf1061 0}{23}{}
{3}{I was wondering if you could help me?}{}{5}{me 0,gf1058 0,lf2 0,gf1061 0}{20}{}
{4}{Do you know where I could find the Black Mountain Clan?}{}{5}{lf2 0,me 0,gf1061 0}{26}{lf 2 1}
{5}{I have brought you the book you wished to read.}{}{5}{qu1044 2,in 5251,gf1061 0}{113}{}
{6}{I found this book on the boat, would you care to read it?}{}{5}{qu1044 1,in 5251,gf1061 0}{113}{}
{7}{Hi. I look for little beard men.}{}{-4}{gf1060 0,gf1061 0}{122}{}
{8}{Hi, Og.}{}{-4}{gf1060 1,gf1061 0}{139}{}
{9}{I was victorious in the pit. May I enter now?}{}{5}{gf1038 1,gf1036 0,gf1061 0}{145}{re 39}
{10}{I was victorious in the pit. May I enter now?}{}{5}{gf1059 1,gf1036 0,gf1061 0}{18}{}
{11}{Hello Ogdin, may I ask you some questions?}{}{5}{me 1,gf1061 0}{105}{}
{12}{May I ask you some questions?}{}{5}{gf1061 1}{13}{}
{13}{It is you, is it? I suppose you feel you've made me look the fool with your stealthy antics, eh?}{It is you, is it? I suppose you feel you've made me look the fool with your stealthy antics, eh?}{}{}{}{re 30}
{14}{I had no choice. It was imperative that I speak with Thorvald.}{}{5}{}{15}{}
{15}{You had best step lightly in my presence, miscreant.}{You had best step lightly in my presence, miscreant.}{}{}{}{}
{16}{I'll step lightly on your face with my boot, fool!}{}{5}{}{0}{co}
{17}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{18}{Your skills are most impressive. No one has ever beaten Borag.}{Your skills are most impressive. No one has ever beaten Borag.}{}{}{}{re +5}
{19}{Thank you. May I see Thorvald now?}{}{5}{}{145}{}
{20}{Sure, what can I do for you?}{Sure, what can I do for you?}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Do you know where I could find the Black Mountain Clan?}{}{5}{}{26}{}
{22}{I'm looking for some dwarves, can you help me?}{}{5}{}{33}{}
{23}{I am Ogdin. What is it you wish to speak to me about?}{I am Ogdin. What is it you wish to speak to me about?}{}{}{}{}
{24}{It's imperative that I find the dwarf Thorvald, to speak with him.}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{25}{Do you know where I could find the Black Mountain Clan?}{}{5}{lf2 0}{26}{}
{26}{That is a Dwarven Clan, is it not?}{That is a Dwarven Clan, is it not?}{}{}{}{}
{27}{Yes.}{}{5}{}{28}{}
{28}{You will not find them here, good sir. Your time would be better spent searching the mountains of the mainland.}{You will not find them here, madam.  Your time would be better spent searching the mountains of the mainland.}{}{}{}{}
{29}{You haven't seen any Dwarves?}{}{5}{}{33}{}
{30}{They are not there. I was told I could find them here.}{}{5}{}{31}{}
{31}{I have no knowledge of any dwarves on this island other than Thorvald.}{I have no knowledge of any dwarves on this island other than Thorvald.}{}{}{}{gf1058 1}
{32}{What can you tell me of Thorvald?}{}{5}{}{35}{}
{33}{There is only one Dwarf who resides here in this dreadful place. Thorvald. Some would say he is the leader of the poor souls of this island.}{There is only one Dwarf who resides here in this dreadful place. Thorvald. Some would say he is the leader of the poor souls of this island.}{}{}{}{ru2025, lf5 1}
{34}{Tell me more about this fellow.}{}{5}{}{35}{}
{35}{Thorvald? He has been here for a very long time, longer than any of us. He may be able to supply you with the answers you seek.}{Thorvald? He has been here for a very long time, longer than any of us. He may be able to supply you with the answers you seek.}{}{}{}{}
{36}{Where can I find him?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{37}{What do you mean "some" consider him a leader?}{}{5}{lf5 1}{38}{}
{38}{We have no real form of government, nor do we have titles. Thorvald is just someone that many of the people here look to for guidance. Then again, some do not.}{We have no real form of government, nor do we have titles. Thorvald is just someone that many of the people here look to for guidance. Then again, some do not.}{}{}{}{}
{39}{Where can I find him?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{40}{Thorvald resides behind these doors. Only a select few are allowed an audience. It is my charge to filter out those undeserving of the honor.}{Thorvald resides behind these doors. Only a select few are allowed an audience. It is my charge to filter out those undeserving of the honor.}{}{}{}{}
{41}{He may be able to help me. I must speak with him.}{}{5}{}{66}{}
{42}{No offense, but you seem very articulate for an ogre.}{}{5}{lf3 0}{43}{}
{43}{No offense perceived, sir. In actuality, I am but a half-ogre. Never having had contact with either of my parents, I do not have any information as to the specific nature of my lineage.}{No offense perceived. In actuality, I am but a half-ogre. Never having had contact with either of my parents, I do not have any information as to the specific nature of my lineage.}{}{}{}{}
{44}{You never knew your parents?}{}{5}{}{45}{}
{45}{No. I have a vague recollection of the orphanage though, but something about the memory seems a bit peculiar.}{No. I have a vague recollection of the orphanage though, but something about the memory seems a bit peculiar.}{}{}{}{}
{46}{What seems peculiar about it?}{}{5}{}{47}{}
{47}{It is a most strange thing.  As I remember it, all the other children were half-ogres like myself.}{It is a most strange thing.  As I remember it, all the other children were half-ogres like myself.}{}{}{}{}
{48}{What's wrong with that?}{}{5}{}{49}{}
{49}{It is very rare that a human and an ogre would mate, and most of the time these couplings are the result of force. If there were significant numbers of rapes being committed by ogres, I believe the newspapers would have been overflowing with calls to eradicate ogres.}{It is very rare that a human and an ogre would mate, and most of the time these couplings are the result of force. If there were significant numbers of rapes being committed by ogres, I believe the newspapers would have been overflowing with calls to eradicate ogres.}{}{}{}{}
{50}{Were you ever placed in a home?}{}{5}{}{54}{}
{51}{I have noticed that many city gnomes use half-ogre servants.}{}{5}{}{52}{}
{52}{Now that you mention it, it does seem a bit strange. Even I spent some time myself as a servant to a gnome of rather high standing.}{Yes, that is very strange. I even worked for a gnome for a number of years.}{}{}{}{}
{53}{Did you work for gnomes your whole life, before coming here?}{}{5}{}{54}{}
{54}{No. From a very early age I remember working in a printers shop, from the early morning hours to well into the evening.  I would then retire to the storage room where I was allowed to rest for a few hours. The next day I would be up before day break to start again.}{No. From a very early age I remember working in a printers shop, from the early morning hours to well into the evening.  I would then retire to the storage room where I was allowed to rest for a few hours. The next day I would be up before day break to start again.}{}{}{}{}
{55}{That sounds truly distressing. How long did you work there for?}{}{5}{}{56}{}
{56}{I've no way to gauge how long I spent in that miserable shop. Eventually I was "rescued" by a well to do gnome who made a big show about paying the print master a sum of money for the "inconvenience". I now recognize this as the accepted way to buy and sell individuals. I worked for Mr. Chaplaine until I was sent here.}{I've no way to gauge how long I spent in that miserable shop. Eventually I was "rescued" by a well to do gnome who made a big show about paying the print master a sum of money for the "inconvenience". I now recognize this as the accepted way to buy and sell individuals. I worked for Mr. Chaplaine until I was sent here.}{}{}{}{}
{57}{Why were you sent here?}{}{5}{}{58}{}
{58}{Mr. Chaplaine did not wish to have a "savage" serving his guests, so he hired a tutor for me. Miriam was her name. I never knew that humans could be kind, or even what kindness was until I met her. She taught me for three years, until I began to ask too many questions.}{Mr. Chaplaine did not wish to have a "savage" serving his guests, so he hired a tutor for me. Miriam was her name. I never knew that humans could be kind, or even what kindness was until I met her. She taught me for three years, until I began to ask too many questions.}{}{}{}{}
{59}{What happened then?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{60}{The more I questioned the more agitated Mr. Chaplaine became. Early one morning the constable came to the house and escorted me away. I didn't even see Mr. Chaplaine. My fate did not become evident until I was on the ship coming here.}{The more I questioned the more agitated Mr. Chaplaine became. Early one morning the constable came to the house and escorted me away. I didn't even see Mr. Chaplaine. My fate did not become evident until I was on the ship coming here.}{}{}{}{lf3 1}
{61}{Why did they send you here?}{}{5}{}{62}{}
{62}{People don't like their property to ask too many difficult questions. Being an influential gnome, it was a simple matter for him to have me shipped here. I believe I was perceived as a potential "agitator of the workers".}{People don't like their property to ask too many difficult questions. Being an influential gnome, it was a simple matter for him to have me shipped here. I believe I was perceived as a potential "agitator of the workers".}{}{}{}{}
{63}{I am sorry for you. Could you allow me to see Thorvald?}{}{5}{lf1 0,gf1036 0}{66}{}
{64}{So the Pit it is the only way to gain audience with Thorvald?}{}{9}{lf1 1,gf1036 0}{92}{lf4 1}
{65}{May I ask you another question?}{}{5}{gf1036 1}{105}{}
{66}{I have a very specific rule I am pledged to follow. No one enters without first proving themselves on the field of battle, so to speak.}{I have a very specific rule I am pledged to follow. No one enters without first proving themselves on the field of battle, so to speak.}{}{}{}{}
{67}{The "field of battle"?}{}{5}{}{68}{}
{68}{The field of battle in this instance would be "The Pit". Barbaric, but effective in detouring the undesirable element.}{The field of battle in this instance would be "The Pit". Barbaric, but effective in detouring the undesirable element.}{}{}{}{gf1060 1, lf4 1}
{69}{The Pit?}{}{5}{}{70}{}
{70}{The island is sorely lacking in any kind of entertainment, so the men invented their own barbaric form, pit fighting.}{The island is sorely lacking in any kind of entertainment, so the men invented their own barbaric form, pit fighting.}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
{71}{I must prove my self in the Pit? Win a fight?}{}{5}{}{89}{}
{72}{It sounds as if you don't necessarily approve of the Pit fights.}{}{5}{}{73}{}
{73}{I don't mind them, they make my job easier. They're just not my particular brand of entertainment. I would rather pass the time with a good book.}{I don't mind them, they make my job easier. They're just not my particular brand of entertainment. I would rather pass the time with a good book.}{}{}{}{}
{74}{Who do I see about a fight?}{}{5}{}{86}{}
{75}{No offense, but you seem very articulate for an ogre.}{}{5}{lf3 0}{43}{}
{76}{You appreciate a good book, do you?}{}{5}{qu1044 0}{77}{}
{77}{Sadly, yes.}{Sadly, yes.}{}{}{}{}
{78}{Why sadly?}{}{5}{}{79}{}
{79}{There are not many books on the island. What good is a love of books when there is none to be had?}{There are not many books on the island. What good is a love of books when there is none to be had?}{}{}{}{qu1044 1}
{80}{I recently saw a book, by . Would it interest you?}{}{5}{gf1062 1}{83}{}
{81}{ I found this book, "The Hand" would you like it?}{}{5}{in 5251}{113}{}
{82}{That's too bad. Is fighting in the pit the only way to see Thorvald?}{}{5}{}{92}{}
{83}{Why yes! That would most splendid. I would be most pleased if could retrieve it for me.}{Why yes! That would most splendid. I would be most pleased if could retrieve it for me.}{}{}{}{}
{84}{It would be my pleasure.}{}{5}{}{0}{qu1044 2}
{85}{I don't have the time. I must speak with Thorvald.}{}{5}{}{86}{}
{86}{Go speak with Gorrin, the pit master. He will arrange a fight if you wish.}{Go speak with Gorrin, the pit master. He will arrange a fight if you wish.}{}{}{}{gf1060 1, ru2024}
{87}{I will. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{88}{Can I ask you another question?}{}{5}{}{105}{}
{89}{Yes. If you are interested go speak with Gorrin, the pit master. He will arrange a fight if you wish.}{Yes. If you are interested go speak with Gorrin, the pit master. He will arrange a fight if you wish.}{}{}{}{ru2024}
{90}{Winning in the Pit is the only way to get in to see Thorvald?}{}{5}{}{92}{}
{91}{I will find another way. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{92}{I am afraid so.}{I am afraid so.}{}{}{}{}
{93}{You're an educated individual, you must see I'm not a commoner.}{}{8}{lf4 1,ps 8}{97}{lf 4 0}
