{96}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{lf4 0}
{97}{Yes, it has been very pleasant speaking to you. It is a nice change.}{Yes, it has been very pleasant speaking to you. It is a nice change.}{}{}{}{}
{98}{Must I bother with that barbaric pit fight? It's pointless violence.}{}{5}{}{100}{}
{99}{Very well, I'll fight. Who must I see?}{}{5}{}{86}{}
